The necessity of developing social skills for college students


##
  Nowadays, that students develop social skills has become a common phenomenon. Opinions vary from person to person. As far as I am concerned, developing social skills is very
necessary for students.
  For one thing, to get a social skill can assist students to get a job more easily. Students may be more liked in society and company if they developed social skills before. 
And for the own of developing social skills, being able to improve students' work ability. For another, developing social skills can help students to enhance their communication, 
which help them defence losing job.When they lose a job, they may get a new quickly through their good social skills.
  From my perspective, students should develop social skills for their future. Only in this way can students find a good job.

## 逐处错误标注
1. that students develop social skills → developing social skills 动名词作主语，that 引导主语从句在此生硬，不符合四级写作习惯
2. to get a social skill → possessing social skills 表达不当；“拥有能力” 用 possess，skills 常用复数
3. assist students to get → assist students in finding 固定搭配 assist sb. in doing sth.
4. company → companies 泛指多家公司，需要复数
5. if they developed → if they develop if 引导条件状语从句，用一般现在时表将来
6. for the own of → 删掉，无此短语；being able to improve… → possessing social skills helps improve… 原句缺少谓语，不是完整句子
7. which help → which helps which 指代前面整件事，谓语动词用单数
8. defence losing job → cooperate well with others, which helps them get more useful information defence 是名词，不能作谓语，原句逻辑更换
9. get a new → get help 删掉不合适的指代，改写句子


