### 逐处错误标注
1. acknowleged → acknowledged（拼写错误）
2. develop a social skill → develop social skills（泛指社交能力，用复数）
3. If one person → If a person（one person 书面此处不如 a person 自然，四级常用）
4. qualify this job → is qualified for the job（固定搭配 be qualified for）
5. get a good impression → leave a good impression（固定搭配，留下好印象）
6. having a good social → having good social skills（social 是形容词，后面缺名词 skills）
7. elevate efficency → improve efficiency（拼写错误；efficiency 常用 improve 搭配）
8. For cooperative job → For cooperative work（job 可数，此处用不可数 work 更合适）
9. a student have great social skills → students with great social skills（原句双谓语错误）
10. make team integral → unite the team（表达生硬，不符合英文习惯）
11. have a ability → gain the ability（ability 元音开头用 an；此处特指用 the，gain 更贴合 “习得”）
12. problems on communication or business → communication or business problems（介词 on 多余，语序调整更地道）


